+    Pure unit tests for the Appointment & Scheduling Application layer.
+    Deliberately references ONLY the Application project: no Api, no Infrastructure,
+    no EF Core, no Postgres, no Kafka. Every collaborator is replaced by a Moq test
+    double, so a failing test can only mean a defect in the service logic itself.
